      416        RADIO-BUTTONS
      417             "Глобально", 0,
      418   "Фирма", 1,
      419   "Объект", 2
      420        SIZE 63 BY 1 NO-UNDO.
      421   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-region
      422        EDGE-PIXELS 2 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
      423        SIZE 72 BY 6.46.
      424   DEFINE QUERY BR-cash-desk FOR
      425         tt-cash-desk SCROLLING.
